import AlgebraicComplexity.Analysis.ProportionalMultinomialCore

/-!
# Structural-zero entropy identity

The entropy identity for integral profiles with structural zeroes,
`log_proportionalEntropyBase_of_profileMass_pos`, and the zero-safe positivity of the Stirling
exponential term, `factorialEntropyTerm_pos_zeroSafe`, are proved in
`AlgebraicComplexity.Analysis.ProportionalMultinomialCore`, where the positive-profile special
case `log_proportionalEntropyBase` is derived from the zero-safe form rather than reproved.
This module remains the import point for the structural-zero development, which deliberately
does not import word-type counting.
-/
